#
#  03.01.2025 v1.5.3 /bs
#    the script now changes the working directory to ${CLANG_SYSROOT} if it is currently "/"
#
#  21.01.2025 v1.5.4 /bs
#    added the function define_aliase to define aliase for the binaries in the clang19 toolchain
#    added the function clear_aliase to delete the alias for the binaries in the clang19 toolchain
#
#  08.02.2026 v1.5.5 /bs
