#    the script now changes the working directory to "/data/local/tmp/develop" if the current working directory is "/" and if  that directory exists. If this directory
#    does not exist, the script changes the working directory to "/data/local/tmp/sysroot"
#
#  02.04.2026 v1.5.8 /bs
#    added the alias gdb="gdb -tui"
#
#  18.04.2026 v1.5.9 /bs
